    "direction": {
      "premise": "Two estate investigators reconstruct why a property ledger vanished before a redevelopment option was signed.",
      "experience_targets": [
        "Each Seat begins with distinct professional knowledge.",
        "No accusation succeeds without corroboration across access, motive, and transaction evidence.",
        "A realistic forged document becomes legible narrative evidence without becoming the owner of story truth."
      ],
